#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:1
msgid "26.03"
msgstr "26.03"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:3
msgid ""
"As of this release the versioning of NumaHOP changes. It was previously "
"using semantic versioning and now uses Calendar Versioning. We plan to do "
"two releases per year in March and September which makes the version numbers "
"for this year `26.03` and `26.09`."
msgstr ""
"La numérotation des versions de NumaHOP changent. Le système précédant utilisait "
"les versions sémantiques et nous passons au système calendaire. Nous prevoyons de faire "
"deux version par ans, une en Mars et une en Septembre. Cela donne les version `26.03` et "
"`26.09` pour cette année."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:5
msgid ""
"This release is mostly plumbing changes with a few bug fixes and a small "
"improvement in the user interface."
msgstr ""
"Cette version contiens majoritairement des changements de plomberie et quelque "
"corrections de bug ainsi qu'une petite amelioration d'interface utilisateur." 

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:7
msgid "Users"
msgstr "Utilisateurs"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:9
msgid ""
"The button on the preview page for Document Units can now open the details "
"page in a new tab by using `Ctrl+Click`."
msgstr ""
"Le bouton sur la page de pre-visualisation pour les Unités Documentaires peut maintenant "
"ouvrir la page des details dans un nouvel ongle en utilisant le `Ctrl+Click`."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:11
msgid "A few bugs are now fixed:"
msgstr "Queques corrections de bugs:"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:13
msgid ""
"Fix a bug in the Cines export were a distant XML dependency was inaccessible."
msgstr ""
"Correction d'un bug où une dépendance xml distante etais inaccessible."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:14
msgid ""
"Fix a bug were the Internet Archive URL was wrong and added a system "
"configuration for it."
msgstr ""
"Correction d'un bug où l'URL de Internet Archive n'étais plus valide et "
"ajout d'une option de config yaml."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:16
msgid "Developers"
msgstr "Developpeurs"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:18
msgid ""
"The java code formatter was changed to `spring-javaformat` as there was "
"multiple java formatters present in the codebase. This one is not "
"configurable in any way, and it's an advantage as we don't have to argue "
"about the configuration of the code formatter."
msgstr ""
"Le formatteur de code a ete change pour `spring-javaformat`. Il y avait "
"plusieurs formatteurs presents. Celui ci n'est pas configurable. "
"C'est un avantage car cela rend les disputes sur la configuration du formatteur "
"inexistantes."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:20
msgid ""
"The queries in the JPQL were reformatted using multi-line strings because "
"the concatenation was broken by the new formatter."
msgstr ""
"Les requete en JPQL on etee reformatee en utilisant des chaines de charactere "
"mulit-lignes car la concatenation les rendait illisible. Consequence du changement "
"du formatteur."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:22
msgid ""
"The `Makefile` was replaced by a `justfile`. Just is a true command runner "
"as opposed to make which is intended to be a simple build system based on "
"file timestamps. The `justfile` is more suited for executing commands and "
"accepting arguments in rules. You can find the installation instructions for "
"just here [github.com/casey/just](https://github.com/casey/just?tab=readme-"
"ov-file#installation)."
msgstr ""
"Le `Makefile` a ete remplace par un `justfile`. Just est un vrai lanceur de "
"commandes contrairement a gnumake qui est plutot fait pour etre un system de build "
"simple. Le `justfile` est mieu adapte pour lancer des commandes arbitraires et "
"accepte des arguments dans ses regles. Vous pouvez trouver les instruction pour "
"l'installer ici [gihtub.com/casey/just](https://github.com/casey/just?tab=readme"
"-ov-file#installation)"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:24
msgid ""
"Improved the maven build option to give more control when building during "
"development. This is achieved with profiles, which were used in the "
"Makefile. A `checks` profile was added. It contains formatting validation. "
"You can add the argument `-Dfast` or `-P!checks` to skip them for faster "
"compile times. A `docker` profile was added for compiling the docker image. "
"It is disabled by default. If you want to build the docker image for NumaHOP "
"run `mvn compile -Pdocker`. A `webapp`profile was added. It is enabled by "
"default. You can disable it with `-Dskip-front-end`. This will skip the "
"bundling of the front-end code in the NumaHOP jar. Useful if you are working "
"on the back-end to have faster compilation times. It pairs well with the "
"front-end served by grunt locally."
msgstr ""
"Le build maven a ete amélioré pour donner plus de controlle pendant le développent."
"Un profil `checks` a été ajouté. Il contiens la validation du formattage. Vous pouvez "
"passer `-Dfast` ou `-P!checks` a maven pour le desactiver. Un profil `docker` a été ajouté "
"Celui-ci est desactive par défaut. Si vous vouler construire l'image Docker de NumaHOP lancez "
"`mvn compile -Pdocker`. Un profil `webapp` a été ajouté. Il est actifs par defaut et permet "
"d'inclure le front-end de NumaHOP dans le jar. Il est interessant de le desactiver lors du "
"développement lorsque grunt sers lui meme le front-end."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:26
msgid ""
"A little bit of code documentation was present in the source but the tools "
"to generate documentation sites were not configured. They are now (see: "
"`just doc`)."
msgstr ""
"Un petit peu de documentation du code était présente mais les outils de génération "
"n'etais pas configurés. Il le sont (voir: `just doc`)."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:28
msgid "Administrators"
msgstr "Administrateurs"

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:30
msgid ""
"NumaHOP is now able to output structured logs in the ECS format. See the "
"configuration options for more details. The feature that allowed the special "
"user `admin` to download log files was removed as we consider anyone that "
"can log in as this user should have access to the server hosting numahop and "
"as such the log files present."
msgstr ""
"NumaHOP est maintenant capable de generer des log au format ECS. Voir les "
"options de configuration statique pour plus de details. La fonctionnalitee qui "
"permet a l'utilisateur `admin` de télécharger les fichier de logs a ete enlevée."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:32
msgid ""
"A new option for configuring the Elasticsearch separator between the prefix "
"and the name of the indexes used by numahop was added: "
"`elasticsearch.index.separator`."
msgstr ""
"Une nouvelle option de configuration pour configurer le séparateur entre le préfixe "
"et le nom des indexs elasticsearch de NumaHOP a été ajoutée:"
"`elasticsearch.index.separator`."

#: build-src/releases/26.03.md:34
msgid ""
"The `jsch` dependency was updated making NumaHOP able to use newer ssh key "
"algorithms (e.g. ed25519)."
msgstr ""
"La dépendance `jsch` a ete mise a jour. NumaHOP est maintenant capable d'utiliser "
"des algorithmes plus récents pour ses clés ssh."

